# Korriban, the secret tomb (TSL, 711KOR, 710KOR, 701KOR, to 003EBO), the Exile alone: the
# entrance's scene, the first vision (Malak recruiting the Jedi for the
# Mandalorian Wars: fought at once, Malak's fall fades the others), east
# past the shyrack wyrms, the severed arm's datapad (Jedi Entombed), the
# locked door [Security]ed, the shyrack brood's nest, the dark energy door and the
# second vision (Dxun's minefield: no Dark Path reply, the Exile goes up
# first and disarms the mines, the Mandalorians' charge fought), the Hssiss
# at the junction, the locked door south [Security]ed to the dead Jedi (searched once:
# the quest's end, two Hssiss), north to the third vision (Kreia against
# the companions: Kreia protected so she may be redeemed, LSP, the vision
# fought out at her side), the last vision ("Revan", the Exile's dark double,
# fought), Kreia's word at Ludo Kressh's sarcophagus, his armband and war
# sword, the crypt rooms' bins, out the back to the cave, and aboard.
# Starts at the tomb's door:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @korriban_tomb data/routes/tsl/korriban_secret_tomb.route --god
# Walkthroughs: DSimpson's "Sith Cavern", GameBanshee's "Secret Tomb",
# Kerbow's "Shyrack Cave" 1-5 (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Also the side rooms: the first vision's (north to the rubble, south to the
# locked chest, a shyrack wyrm pair each) and the minefield's (south to a
# chest and rubble, a wyrm). The jars and urns are props (not useable).
#
# ASSUMES:
# - The Exile is alone: a_tomb sent every companion to the Ebon Hawk's base
#   (RemoveNPCFromPartyToBase) as 711KOR loaded.
# - Every vision sets the Exile at one hit point at least (SetMinOneHP);
#   as one fades, pc_death plays ("What is happening to me?") and
#   a_death_jump sets him on past it.
# - The Exile's Security (DC 28 doors, a total of 18 and 20 taken) opens the
#   locked doors; his Demolitions (4 ranks, 8 with Intelligence, the build's
#   last skill) disarms the vision's mines.
talk                 # tr_first_enter: the entrance's scene (entrance_cs)
say Enough games, draw your lightsaber and fight! # Malak (malak)
to tr_1st_vision     # the doors shut behind (711_norm_door, 711_1st_door)
talk
fight 30             # Malak; his fall fades the Jedi (k_fab_malak_ud), the doors unlock
use LowShdLndRubble@3 # the first vision's north room
fight 30
use TresRakatLock@3  # and its south room
fight 30
to 711_norm_door@1   # east
fight 30             # the shyrack wyrms
use SevrdArm         # the severed arm's datapad (a_jedi_tomb_jrnl: Jedi Entombed)
unlock 711_lock_door@1 # "Door{Locked, Bashable}" (DC 28) [Security]
fight 30             # the shyrack brood's nest
say This is Dxun... the heart of the Mandalorian crusade. # the Republic Captain (re_flash):
say Only Revan could answer that. # no Dark Path ("The battle is an invaluable
say [Demolitions] Let me go first # opportunity", "War calls for blood", "Now charge!"): the
                     # Exile goes first to disable the mines (c_sc_dem_gt: over 5)
to tr_kill_shyrak@1  # the dark energy before the door (DarkForce_shyrak)
to wp_2nd_pc         # through 711_2nd_door@1: its OnOpen (tr_pc_god) starts the captain
talk
to 50.36,-30.63      # the mines disarmed west to east, each from 2.2 m off
disarm 52.4,-29.9    # its 1.5 m ring (a walk coasts on) and out of the next's (the Exile's
to 51.06,-31.56      # Demolitions, 2.5 m reach; one he fails is sprung); the
disarm 52.7,-33.0    # area's heartbeat (k_hb_check_mines) has the captain
to 53.15,-31.32      # charge once no mine is left round check_mines (the two
disarm 55.3,-31.3    # last, g_t_trap016, "{KillsOnEnter}": a_mine_killnpc,
to 56.46,-31.21      # Republic soldiers only)
disarm 58.7,-31.2
to 59.71,-31.17
disarm 61.9,-31.2
to 62.9,-31.14
disarm 65.1,-31.1
talk                 # "And now we fight!": the Mandalorians rush in (re_flash start 2, a_spawn_mand)
fight 30             # the Mandalorians fade as the vision ends (k_mand_fade_ud)
use TresRakatLock@2  # the minefield's south room
use LowShdLndRubble@2
fight 30
to 711_2nd_door@3    # east
fight 30             # the Hssiss at the junction
to 711_norm_door@6   # south
fight 30             # the shyrack wyrms
unlock 711_lock_door@2 # the dead Jedi's door (Locked, Bashable) [Security]
use MidShdLndRubble  # beside it
use jedi_cont        # the dead Jedi (Nebelish's expedition): Jedi Entombed done (a_jedi_jrnl_fin)
fight 20             # the two Hssiss its search calls (searched once only)
say Despite our differences, we need to work together. # Kreia's vision (kreia_vs), first time
say Can I just say something?
say What they are doing is wrong. I will stand with you, Kreia.
say I will protect you, Kreia, so that you may be redeemed later. # (LSP)
to tr_evil_kreia     # north through 711_last_door@2; the way on locked (711_last_door@1)
talk
fight 30             # the companions' visions, Kreia beside the Exile: the vision fought out
                     # ("Fight with Kreia is done", 711kor_ud case 5, unlocks 711_last_door)
to tr_last_vision    # through 711_last_door@1: the Exile's dark double (g_darkpc) made
to tr_revan_appears  # "Revan" (revan_fake)
talk                 # (its first reply, no alignment)
# kreia_tm, which rev_end starts as the double falls: Kreia on the trials
# (not "I am sick of your counsel", -INF; not the vain "such was my
# destiny"), asked first, as the fight below plays into it.
say This was all a test?
say What do you know of the future?
say I don't know, Kreia. I feel that this tomb has changed me... and not for the better.
say I'm ready to leave.
fight 30             # the double; 711kor_ud then unlocks the crypt doors and starts rev_end
talk
use sarc_door        # the Ancient Sarcophagus (its OnOpen, tr_kreia_tm, finds her word said)
use sith_mummy       # Ludo Kressh's armband and war sword
use TresRakatBin     # the south crypt room (crypt_door@2)
use TresRakatLock@1
use LowShdLndRubble@1 # the north crypt room (crypt_door@1)
exit To_710_2        # through crypt_door@3, back to the cave by the sealed door
module 710kor
say I'm not ready yet. # sec_tomb again by the sealed door (start 1, "Are you ready to
exit To_701          # enter the tomb?"); then back up through the cleared cave, alone
module 701kor
fight 30             # anything about the valley
to to_ebonhawk_custom # aboard for the companions (tr_ehawk_custom, StartNewModule):
module 003ebo        # DSimpson takes them up from the party screen; aboard it is the ramp's
save korriban_tomb_done
